    "3 days left on the Kept Pro we gave you. Grab a plan to keep it going." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Quedan 3 días del Kept Pro que te regalamos. Elige un plan para seguir disfrutándolo."
